{"screen_name": "rinnoasan", "file": "rinnoasan-235572", "name": "りんの@COMICホリデイ連載中", "avatar_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_images/1624590733960429569/PIm9OUrw.jpg", "header_url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/profile_banners/1335633295/1740459594/1500x500", "description": "成年向けも女性向けも描く漫画描き。COMICホリデイにて「光なき聖女は冷酷王太子に寵愛される」連載中（別名義）&「性交パンチライン」発売中！ ▪️Skeb（たまに募集）→http://skeb.jp/@rinnoasan ◾️ご連絡はDMか pixv内メールにて", "total_works": 30, "scraped_works": 30, "first_seen": "2026-03-20T17:26:46.929317+00:00", "last_updated": "2026-03-20T17:26:46.929317+00:00", "price_history": {"art": [{"amount": 8000, "recorded_at": "2026-03-20T17:26:46.929317+00:00"}]}, "current_prices": {"art": 8000}, "price_range": {"art": {"min": 8000, "max": 8000}}, "links": [{"label": "Twitter", "url": "https://x.com/rinnoasan", "name": "rinnoasan"}, {"label": "Website", "url": "https://rinara.fanbox.cc", "name": ""}, {"label": "Pixiv", "url": "https://www.pixiv.net/users/815308", "name": "815308"}], "flags": {}, "acceptable": false, "works": [{"path": "/@rinnoasan/works/30", "thumbnail_src": "https://si.imgix.net/c3a713e2/uploads/origins/f6573685-43c9-4ed1-b48f-080e0c86d219?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c04421a522d39914eafa99d9862fe78", "thumbnail_srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/c3a713e2/uploads/origins/f6573685-43c9-4ed1-b48f-080e0c86d219?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=2c04421a522d39914eafa99d9862fe78, https://si.imgix.net/c3a713e2/uploads/origins/f6573685-43c9-4ed1-b48f-080e0c86d219?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=f38a54c1059dbfb84d56bfd4433559a0 2x, https://si.imgix.net/c3a713e2/uploads/origins/f6573685-43c9-4ed1-b48f-080e0c86d219?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&s=dcd657f3954806af6c753ee484234257 3x", "genre": "art", "nsfw": true, "body": "こんにちは、rinnoasan！もし興味があれば、お願いがあります。\n\nテイルズ オブ エクシリア』のジュード・マティスとアグリアをお願いします。\n\nジュードはアグリアの後ろで小